{"4165290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gnomad", "steam_appid": 4165290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive pointy-red-cap first into a strange world bursting at the seams with strange foes and stranger friends. Traverse terrain and battle monsters by bouncing balls back and forth. Face large enemies and bosses in chaotic battles full of exploding projectiles and fast paced rallies. Tame the chaos and make it work for you. Oh! And maybe make some friends along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165290/extras/b9adee0724004408d966adc3f4aeb531.avif?t=1775696631\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165290/extras_big/b9adee0724004408d966adc3f4aeb531.webp?t=1775696631 width=1560 height=857 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bounce Through Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do battle by way of bouncing balls! The forest is chock-full of objects and enemies that can be picked up and chucked at your foes. Deflect, redirect, ricochet, and rally your way through the hordes of chaotic enemies. Bounce off of projectiles to unify platforming and combat abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165290/extras/ce90e7721aa4dd739e5aff18d6e14d70.avif?t=1775696631\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165290/extras_big/ce90e7721aa4dd739e5aff18d6e14d70.webp?t=1775696631 width=1560 height=1029 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talk To Strangers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friends and foes alike are just a little bit different down here. Swap gossip, barter for gadgets, and join secret clubs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165290/extras/d3e0f0f2259ac2951d7fd5d536689be0.avif?t=1775696631\" width=1500 height=966 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chart A Hand Crafted World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every detail of this winding, unfolding, whimsical world is placed by hand. Learn the lands and keep an eye out for traps and environmental puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165290/extras/20a33b130940190d72ff81096911c388.avif?t=1775696631\" width=1500 height=888 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trailer Edited By Gavin Cenci. Editor. Trouble Maker Game Co.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music: March of Toys - ANBR Adrián Berenguer provided by Jamendo</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive pointy-red-cap first into a strange world bursting at the seams with strange foes and stranger friends. Traverse terrain and battle monsters by bouncing balls back and forth. Face large enemies and bosses in chaotic battles full of exploding projectiles and fast paced rallies. Tame the chaos and make it work for you. Oh! And maybe make some friends along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165290/extras/b9adee0724004408d966adc3f4aeb531.avif?t=1775696631\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165290/extras_big/b9adee0724004408d966adc3f4aeb531.webp?t=1775696631 width=1560 height=857 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bounce Through Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do battle by way of bouncing balls! The forest is chock-full of objects and enemies that can be picked up and chucked at your foes. Deflect, redirect, ricochet, and rally your way through the hordes of chaotic enemies. Bounce off of projectiles to unify platforming and combat abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165290/extras/ce90e7721aa4dd739e5aff18d6e14d70.avif?t=1775696631\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165290/extras_big/ce90e7721aa4dd739e5aff18d6e14d70.webp?t=1775696631 width=1560 height=1029 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talk To Strangers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friends and foes alike are just a little bit different down here. Swap gossip, barter for gadgets, and join secret clubs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165290/extras/d3e0f0f2259ac2951d7fd5d536689be0.avif?t=1775696631\" width=1500 height=966 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chart A Hand Crafted World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every detail of this winding, unfolding, whimsical world is placed by hand. Learn the lands and keep an eye out for traps and environmental puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165290/extras/20a33b130940190d72ff81096911c388.avif?t=1775696631\" width=1500 height=888 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trailer Edited By Gavin Cenci. Editor. Trouble Maker Game Co.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music: March of Toys - ANBR Adrián Berenguer provided by Jamendo</p>", "short_description": "Gnomad is an offbeat, hand-drawn, bouncing-ball platformer. Play a